      "en": "Dig through the wall in their sight, and carry your baggage out that way.",
      "ko": "너는 그 목전에서 성벽을 뚫고 그리로 좇아 옮기되",
      "source_text_hash": "1d24d2f8344c2c8c45d4fda780b0e08f9813efa6c821aa9b9a7a80b9be2eaea4",
      "translation_text_hash": "16376e1d4db55857a2bd97588caf0e8a4335b5afa83c4f95b6cdd5600f755c4c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
