      "en": "In the morning, the LORD’s word came to me, saying,",
      "ko": "이튿날 아침에 여호와의 말씀이 또 내게 임하여 가라사대",
      "source_text_hash": "5315f46300e5eab625923f8c2dc45f997d7a5ca7447b5e5695f60bceca77e8fa",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f7f4bc6d3ce0087897493ffbff2c9ce0ca8fc100cf646affe0f8e976e49b41c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이튿날 아침에 여호와의 말씀이 또 내게 임하여 가라사대"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7f7f4bc6d3ce0087897493ffbff2c9ce0ca8fc100cf646affe0f8e976e49b41c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:12:9",
