      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "“Say, ‘I am your sign. As I have done, so will it be done to them. They will go into exile, into captivity.",
      "ko": "또 말하기를 나는 너희 징조라 내가 행한대로 그들이 당하여 사로잡혀 옮겨 갈찌라",
      "source_text_hash": "8996e27e16dd419aa3b775d382d9828bf72c2f6bad9c813fd50cc6ea964b05e7",
      "translation_text_hash": "9c5da8e08b9f4f965a71514b74f8082f85ad500cd55393dfa295ba26f339dd3c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 말하기를 나는 너희 징조라 내가 행한대로 그들이 당하여 사로잡혀 옮겨 갈찌라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
